        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          Clinicians classify color vision deficiency based on whether cone photopigments are <strong>anomalous</strong> (shifted spectral sensitivity) or <strong>completely absent</strong> (dichromacy or monochromacy).
        </p>

